# TextMesh Pro fonts (large SDF/TTF assets).
# ** matches both monorepo paths and nsdk-samples-csharp (Unity project under NsdkSamples/).
**/Assets/TextMesh?Pro/Fonts/*.ttf    filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
**/Assets/TextMesh?Pro/Fonts/*.otf    filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
**/Assets/TextMesh?Pro/Fonts/*.asset  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
